1
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Wê jêrî me vê xwînteyî, gundê Kêlibû ye. Awa gundê Kêlibû
ye.
 
That school down below us, that is Kelibo village. That
there is Kelibo village.

2
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Mofata Ereba, gundê Huseyn... gundê Huseyn kî da xwînte?
 
Mofat of the Arabs, Hussein's village... Who gave the school
to Hussein's village?

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Baben cîranê gundê Gehan e... kesî qurmîşê nabiyê. Awa gundê
Kêlibû ye.
 
Father, the neighbor is Gehan village... no one
stirs/moves... That is Kelibo village.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Mofata Ereba... gundê Huseyn kî da xwînte?
 
Mofat of the Arabs... who gave the school to Hussein's
village?

5
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Taban sincanê gundê Gehan e... kesî qurmîşê nabiyê.
 
Of course, the trees/borders of Gehan village... no one
messes with them.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Yolî por vî... di sê dorxê bînin... bes dorê xwe Gehan e.
 
The road is full of this... bring around three... but its
surrounding is Gehan.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Goti min hatin Efrîn, mekteba Efrîn... reqemê min sersar
e... lêxe...
 
He told me they came to Afrin, the Afrin office... my number
is on it... call it...

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Kusûra me kesî re tûne.
 
We have no offense toward anyone.

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Arê heval no, dîsa êvarek nû û vîdyokî xweş, kîbar.
 
Yes friends, again a new evening and a nice, neat video.

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Taban vîdyê me jî, em kê herin gundê Heyatê. Ji me ra gotin
e gundê Heyatê...
 
Of course regarding our video, we will go to Hayat village.
They told us Hayat village...

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Gundekî zor xweş e. Em kê werin teswîr kin.
 
It is a very nice village. We will come and film it.

12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Bi me ra bin vîdyokî xweş û kîbar, ji bîr nekin te'lîqên
xweş binivîsin.
 
Stay with us for a nice and neat video, don't forget to
write nice comments.

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Înşalla hûnê bextewar bin û bighên miradê dilê xwe bin.
 
God willing you will be happy and reach the desires of your
hearts.

14
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Çavê we giyan maç dikim.
 
I kiss the eyes of you all.

15
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Arê heval no, polîtîkê min ji gundê Heyatê ye, bes hewş
çêkirine berî gundê Heyatê çêkirine.
 
Yes friends, my politics is of Hayat village, but they built
courtyards before they built Hayat village.

16
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Nuha me ferq e gundê Heyatê ne. Ho feke t'xêr.
 
Now strictly speaking we are in Hayat village. Welcome.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Bi me ra bin, emê herin gundê Heyatê.
 
Stay with us, we will go to Hayat village.

18
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Arê heval no, hava hewşa xalê min Ebu Ezîz vêra dibên,
mixtar e.
 
Yes friends, here is the courtyard of my uncle Abu Aziz they
call him here, the Mukhtar.

19
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Ser serî me, ser çavê me. Maşalla hewşekî pir kîbar e ha ye.
 
On our head, on our eyes. Mashallah, it is a very neat
courtyard, look.

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Ji çîçeka binerin ha valî min binerin.
 
Look at the flowers, look my friends.

21
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Ax keda dare me aşiq çîçeka dibim maşalla.
 
Oh, whenever I enter [a garden] I fall in love with flowers,
Mashallah.

22
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Kîbar, yanî kêfî dilê xwe ra çêkiriye, mirovekî mizewiq e.
 
Neat, meaning he made it for his heart's pleasure, he is a
person of taste.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Hewşê xwe pir kîbar e.
 
His courtyard is very neat.

24
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Hişînahî hebe jî... nefesê merov... merov cesediyan gi va
d'hes e.
 
If there is greenery... a person's breath... a person
physically feels it all.

25
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Hevalo we re derbas darûna jî... awa bike.
 
Friend, come pass through the trees too... do like that.

26
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Maşalla. Iî cemaetê çîçeka hez dike.
 
Mashallah. This community loves flowers.

27
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Ew na hişînî hebe, ew na çiqas bêhna pîs [na], tiştê xweş.
 
Where there is greenery, where there is... what a bad smell
[no], good things.

28
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Cerosîm li mentîqê tinne.
 
There are no germs in the area.

29
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Li bajara cerosîm pir e. Ji kilkê û ji tûzê.
 
In the cities, germs are many. From the lime dust and the
dirt.

30
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Ji dûyê mokîna. Bes cewê gunda pak e, xweş e.
 
From the smoke of cars. But the village atmosphere is clean,
it's nice.

31
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Bayê pak tê yanî. Tebîhî ye. Maşalla.
 
Clean wind comes, meaning. It is natural. Mashallah.

32
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Maşalla, ji qolûra Xwedê emrê kî dirêj p dê.
 
Mashallah, from this [environment] God gives a long life.

33
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Xizmet dike, xora rinde.
 
He maintains it, it is good for himself.

34
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Rojbaş.
 
Good day.

35
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Rojbaş, rojbaş.
 
Good day, good day.

36
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
Tu çawa yî apê?
 
How are you uncle?

37
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Arê heval no, xalê min jî vî darê... em rastê hatin.
 
Yes friends, my uncle is also here... we came across him.

38
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:54,000
Avê hejan berdikan... paqişko. Rêkê xwe pak dikan. Xizmet
milkê xwe dikan.
 
Watering the trees... cleaning. Cleaning his path. Serving
his property.

39
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Xalo, tu çi dibêjî ji gundê Heyatê?
 
Uncle, what do you say about Hayat village?

40
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Gundê Heyatê ye...
 
It is Hayat village...

41
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Ser serî min, ser çavê min. Xalo gundê Heyatê... navê gundê
Heyatê ji çi danîne?
 
You are welcome. Uncle, Hayat village... from what did they
name it Hayat village?

42
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Gundê Heyatê... navê xwe vêra Heyat e.
 
Hayat village... its name is Hayat [Life] with it.

43
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:09,000
Gundê Heyatê bi xwe heyat e.
 
Hayat village is life itself.

44
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Wekî çêl pênc mala ye.
 
It is about forty-five houses.

45
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Ew de, avê de xwe hene. Her malekê înçqûbî kû heye.
 
There, they have their own water. Every house has a
well/water source.

46
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Dor ber e, giyê xwe rinde. Tabieta xwe xweş e.
 
Around it, its grass is good. Its nature is nice.

47
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Dor ber e, yanî... her kesî hewşê xwe wekî mezra çêkiriye.
 
Surroundings, meaning... everyone has made their courtyard
like a farm.

48
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Yanî kîbar ji xwe ra çêkirine.
 
Meaning they made it neat for themselves.

49
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Ji xwe ra çêkiriye. Bahal bigî, tiştê xwe bixwe, xudrê xwe
diçînin.
 
Made it for himself. To keep livestock, eat his things, they
plant their vegetables.

50
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Rind e. Siheta xalê min xweş.
 
Good. My uncle's health [be] good.

51
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Hakimiyeta xwe li ser e... xan e yanî.
 
He has control over it... it is an inn/Khan meaning.

52
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Eywa.
 
Yes/Exactly.

53
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Xalê min dibê gundê Heyatê, dibê navê xwe, gundê Heyatê...
bi xwe Heyat e.
 
My uncle says Hayat village, says its name, Hayat village...
is Life itself.

54
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Gundekî pir xweş e, kîbar e. Aqlê hal emê nuka herin nava
gund.
 
A very nice, neat village. Anyhow, we will now go inside the
village.

55
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,000
İnşalla.
 
God willing.

56
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,000
Çêl pênc mal in. Û her kes, hewşê xwe hişta wekî dibê mezra
çêkiriye.
 
Forty-five houses. And everyone, their courtyard thus, as he
says, has made it a farm.

57
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Her kes xizmet dike. Yanî avî xwe.
 
Everyone maintains [it]. Meaning their water.

58
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Ser serî min xalo. Xwedê emrê te dirêj bike de.
 
On my head uncle [Thank you]. May God give you a long life.

59
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,000
Sax be, saxta we giya xweş.
 
Be healthy, health to you all.

60
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:01,000
Dem xweş, Xwedê ji we razî be. Roj xweş.
 
Have a good time, May God be pleased with you. Good day.

61
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:13,000
Ser bi jî.
 
Live long.

62
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Arê heval no, hava camê ye.
 
Yes friends, here is the mosque.

63
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Berî gundê Heyatê... Berî gundê Heyatê çêkirine.
 
Before Hayat village... They built it before Hayat village.

64
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Kîbar çêkirine welle, pak.
 
They built it neatly honestly, clean.

65
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Zurna and Drum playing while driving through the village]
 
Zurna and Drum playing while driving through the village]

66
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:20,000
[Instrumental Music continues]
 
[Instrumental Music continues]

67
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:20,000
[Instrumental Music continues]
 
[Instrumental Music continues]

68
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:20,000
[Instrumental Music continues]
 
[Instrumental Music continues]

69
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:20,000
[Instrumental Music continues]
 
[Instrumental Music continues]

70
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:20,000
[Instrumental Music continues]
 
[Instrumental Music continues]

71
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Erê hevalno, teben gundê Heyatê, eva em ketin gundê Heyatê,
nuka em ji gundê Heyatê derdikevin.
 
Yes friends, naturally Heyatê village, here we entered
Heyatê village, now we are leaving Heyatê village.

72
00:10:54,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Gundê Heyatê jî bi xwe ne mezin e, me go 45 mal in, jê 20
mal xirabe ne, 20 mal xirabe ne.
 
Heyatê village itself isn't big, we said there are 45
houses, 20 of them are ruined, 20 houses are ruined.

73
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:10,000
No jî em ê herin Sewiya, Sewiya pir bilind e. Mentiqa Sewiya
pir xweş e. Bimerin heta em digihîjin Sewiya.
 
Now we will go to Sewiya, Sewiya is very high. The region of
Sewiya is very nice. Stay with us until we reach Sewiya.

74
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Erê hevalno, teben em ji vê gundî hatin. Gundê em jê hatine
eva gundê Heyatê ye.
 
Yes friends, naturally we came from this village. The
village we came from, this is Heyatê village.

75
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Sewiya jî li hafê ye. Hember me jî, vrana gundê Şêxkêlê.
 
Sewiya is on the slope. And opposite us is the face of
Şêxkêlê village.

76
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:29,000
Û piş gundê vo jî Gobek e. Gobek e.
 
And behind that village is Gobek. It is Gobek.

77
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,000
Takro hav jî cuxrafiya gundî Sewiya ye.
 
Roughly this is the geography of Sewiya village.

78
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:35,000
Em ê nuka teben em ê wera kî teswîr kin.
 
Naturally, we will film a bit for you now.

79
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:55,000
Bala xwe bidinê çi mentiqek xweş e viderê, nuka bilindî ye
mentiqa gixwînte.
 
Look at what a nice region this is, now it is high, the
region is visible.

80
00:12:41,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Maşalla zeytûn, mebû zeytûn qort û xîç gulikê derdikevin.
 
Mashallah olives, we said olives sprout their branches even
in bumps and pebbles.

81
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Li malbatê xwe sêr kin, li cîranê xwe sêr kin.
 
Look at your families, look at your neighbors.

82
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Zanibin gundê Sewiya li ku dikeve, gundê Heyatê li ku
dikeve.
 
Know where Sewiya village is situated, where Heyatê village
is situated.

83
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Yanî rûni û... hûn hatin... nizanim min mentiqa... ez ev
rêka darê ke, ev darê ke.
 
I mean, sit and... you came... I don't know the region... I
take this road that goes there, that goes there.

84
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Teben ez ji mentiqê nînim, rêka giş zanim, bes pir gund
hene, navê kuçikê mentiqê ne em nizanin.
 
Naturally I am not from the region, I know all the roads,
but there are many villages, we don't know the names of the
small places in the region.

85
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Were cuxrafî xwe zanibe erê.
 
So know your geography, yes.

86
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Na keçikê we pirr ku li Ewrûpa bîne... wa rî nizanin...
cewkê dayîna.
 
Now, those of your children who have been in Europe for a
long time... you don't know the way... the places of the
mothers.

87
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Bes em vêro teswîr dikin jî, e zanibin.
 
But we are filming this for you, so you will know.

88
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:52,000
Tebîetê vê gundî niha em hewal didin, e bêbe wela vê gunda
filanî, filan derê, e zanibin, e serqaneta lêsêr kin behel.
 
We are showing the nature of this village now, so you can
say "well, this village is so-and-so, that place," so you
will know, watch it carefully anyway.

89
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:58,000
Wele em hinda nebin tiştek.
 
Well, may we not lose anything.

90
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:02,000
Seke maşalla milkê binî viderê bine, vadiye.
 
Look, mashallah, see the property down here, it is a valley.

91
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:18,000
Xizmetê dikin e, çi milk e. Maşalla tê hene.
 
They serve/maintain it, what a property. Mashallah there is
[abundance] in it.

92
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Erê hevalno teben hevo... weyî jêrî me vê xwînte jî gundê
Kêlî bû ye. Abo gundê Kêlî bû ye.
 
Yes friends, naturally here... the one appearing below us is
the Kêlî village. That is the Kêlî village.

93
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Rêka çêkirina, munezeme. Hêjaye.
 
The road is built, organized. It is worthy.

94
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:31,000
Maşalla ev ne bes zeytûne bîne... wey rizqê giyo bişîne.
Maşalla hevalî min vê dornê bigir.
 
Mashallah, these have become not just olives... may He send
sustenance to all. Mashallah, my friend, film this turn.

95
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Havo l'niv wadiye... glîk tê de sefî dikin.
 
Here in the middle of the valley... branches are being lined
up in it.

96
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Em hemû kê qort û şkêlikê derdikevin maşalla. Xwedê rizqê
giyo bişîne, xwedê bereketê tê ke.
 
We are all coming out of the bumps and rocks, Mashallah. May
God send sustenance to all, may God put blessings in it.

97
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:33,000
Erê hevalno, teben ev mewqa, mewqa ji giş dera bilindtir e.
 
Yes friends, naturally this location, the location is higher
than all places.

98
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Ev gundî korta jêr, avo Berben e. Gundê Berben e.
 
This village in the hollow below, that is Berben. Berben
village.

99
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:44,000
Serê çiyayê Reco. Jor jî gulî ye, gulî jor in. Û gulî jêrin
jî di korta do ye.
 
Top of Rajo mountain. Up there is Gulî, Upper Gulî. And
Lower Gulî is in that hollow.

100
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:51,000
Teben cuxrafyek pirr xweş e, mentiqek pirr bilind e. Çiyayê
Reco, Alîko ye.
 
Naturally it is a very nice geography, a very high region.
Rajo mountain, it is Alîko.

101
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:57,000
Ev gundî hember me jî gundê Qûpê ye. Hemşelek wêre dibên.
 
This village opposite us is Qûpê village. They call it
Hemşelek there.

102
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:01,000
Takro ew rîkê wan î darê, hew jî darê be'dîno, gundê
Meydanê.
 
Roughly that road of theirs goes there, that also goes to
Badinan, Meydanê village.

103
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:05,000
Takro jî hemberê Dimilo xwînte. O piş be'dîne ve Dimilo
xwînte.
 
Roughly opposite, Dimilo is visible. And behind Badinan,
Dimilo is visible.

104
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:08,000
Rekim ser kameramên bênê neke.
 
I tell the cameraman, don't shake it.

105
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Tebîetê vir hane şte, seke maşalla bilind e, avo em li gundê
Sewiya ne, li mala xwezî ke.
 
The nature here is like this, look mashallah it's high, here
we are in Sewiya village, at the Xwezî house.

106
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Mentiqek pirr xweş e. Hevalî min jêr du şilê bigir.
 
A very nice region. My friend, film down there a bit.

107
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Mobata, Erebo, Gundê Hisên gi derxwînte.
 
Mabeta, Erebo, Hisên village, all are visible.

108
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:32,000
Maşalla bilindî ye. Gola avê, maşalla avê tê de heye.
 
Mashallah it is height. Water pond, mashallah there is water
in it.

109
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
Xwedê rizqê giyo bişîne, nanê helal bide giya.
 
May God send sustenance to all, may He give halal bread to
all.

110
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:54,000
Zewî bê gundî pirr hênik e... cewkî xweş... bîne pênê bovîna
sarbûna panî pawkî molî dimîne. Cewkî pirr xweş e.
 
The field of this village is very cool... a nice
atmosphere... the smell of the cool breeze... remains in the
home. It is a very nice atmosphere.

111
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:43,000
Teben avo jî mekteb e, çêkirina, munezeme.
 
Naturally that is the school, built, organized.

112
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Em ê herin nûk ziaretê nûko.
 
We will go to the shrine now.

113
00:19:51,000 --> 00:20:11,000
Fena em çend şaşwara bikin.
 
Like we will do a few rounds.

114
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,000
Erê hevalno, em îro gihîştine ziyareta... ziyareta Sêwya.
 
Yes friends, today we have arrived at the shrine... the
shrine of Sewiya.

115
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:27,000
Teb'en sindiyanê gundê gelek kevn e.
 
Of course, the village's oak trees are very old.

116
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:31,000
Yê li dar û... dar û qut dibîne, bes dorê xwe kevn e.
 
Whoever sees the trees and... trees and stumps, but its
surroundings are old.

117
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,000
Belkî mûxterê Rabbil 'alemîn qebûl kir.
 
Perhaps the mukhtar of the Lord of the Worlds accepted it.

118
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:39,000
Yanî şa'bê vê gundî mihafize kir, yanî nêhişt kes dar û qut
ke.
 
Meaning the people of this village preserved it, meaning
they didn't let anyone cut the trees.

119
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:43,000
Birovo ji gundê Sêwya ra... saetê gundiyan xweş.
 
Bravo to the village of Sewiya... health to the villagers.

120
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:48,000
Nha teke sindiyan nebana, sibe xelkê rabana, meselen yek
insanek rehmetî bibûya...
 
Now if it weren't for the oak trees, tomorrow people would
get up, for example if a person passed away...

121
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Tên xwe ra bin darê rûdinin, sarsî ye.
 
They come and sit under the tree, it is shady.

122
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Tena bana, noko dinê germ bû, ê rûyt bû.
 
If it were bare, now that the weather is hot, it would be
exposed.

123
00:21:54,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Bes noko hene rind e maşallah. Saetê vî mêrî jî xweş,
mihafize kirin.
 
But now that they are there, it's good mashallah. Health to
